  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NAM Barnr&#xe4;ttigheter RB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAM Child Rights SCS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka det r&#xe4;ttsliga skyddet f&#xf6;r barn i    Namibia genom att f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka antagandet av the Child Care and         Protection Bill, utbildning av domare f&#xf6;r kunskaps&#xf6;kning om Akten och dess inverkan p&#xe5; deras arbetsuppgifter och att &#xf6;ka medvetenheten hos  barn och deras v&#xe5;rdgivare f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra deras f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att h&#xe4;vda   sina r&#xe4;ttigheter s&#xe5; stipuleras i Akten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen the legal protection of children in    Namibia by advocating for the adoption of the Child Care and          Protection Bill, conducting training of magistrates to increase their knowledge of the Act and its implication on their duties, and to      raise awareness among children and their caregivers to improve their  capacity to claim their rights as stipulated in the Act.</narrative>
  </description>
